<title>USA: Ford unit ups stake in Toledo Molding &amp; Die.</title>
<headline>Ford unit ups stake in Toledo Molding &amp; Die.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co said Tuesday its Automotive Products Operations increased its ownership in Toledo Molding &amp; Die Inc to 35 percent.</p>
<p>Ford said the joint venture between the two companies is developing plastic component designs for future Ford products. It added Toledo Molding manufactures injection and blow molded plastic components.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to say how big Ford's stake in the company was previously.</p>
